LibreYOLO adapts the late-stage adapter for multiscale detection features.
The Drax primitives are reused from LibreYOLO's existing yolo9/drax.py.
Torchvision supplies MobileNetV3 Large as a runtime dependency (BSD-3-Clause);
no torchvision source or pretrained weights are bundled in this module.
ImageNet initialization uses MobileNet_V3_Large_Weights.IMAGENET1K_V2.
No separate license for those weights is asserted here.

